OL,3,GNEWSAOne-third fewer children in
OL,4,Atemporary housing
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe number of children living in
OL,7,Ftemporary accommodation in a city has
OL,8,Ffallen by a third over the past four
OL,9,Fyears.
OL,11,FPeterborough City Council said the
OL,12,Fnumber of homeless families with
OL,13,Fchildren placed in short-term housing
OL,14,Fhad declined following a strategy to
OL,15,Freduce its reliance on
OL,16,Fbed-and-breakfast accommodation.
OL,18,FThe authority began overhauling its
OL,19,Ftemporary accommodation provision after
OL,20,Foverspending by #1.7m in 2024, but said
OL,21,Fdemand had become more complex in
OL,22,Frecent years.
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
